---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
The emails behind one count, newest first: exactly as many as the count. Defaults to the line's window

Usage: mxr arrivals list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --mode <MODE>        messages, todo, updates, reading, archive, screened_out, spam or sorting. Omitted: every arrival
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --since <SINCE>      RFC 3339; the default is the line's window
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
      --until <UNTIL>
      --limit <LIMIT>      [default: 100]
  -h, --help               Print help
